# EI + ROBOT comparison

The method fits a scalar Gaussian-process surrogate for the final detection
score `g(x)=P_detect` and applies the same ROBOT h-space trust-region and
diversity filter used by EI-CF + ROBOT. The ROBOT diversity constraint uses scaled L1 distance, with the threshold `tau` set by the empirical CDF of pairwise distances among measurable training events.

## Entry point

Use `run_multi_seed.py` for experiments. The `run_bo.py` module is kept only
because `run_multi_seed.py` imports its internal `run_single()` function.

```bash
python run_multi_seed.py \
  --seeds 1-10 \
  --n-iterations 30 \
  --acquisition ROBOT_DIRECT_EI \
  --robot-distance-mode tail_l1 \
  --robot-tau-quantile 75
```
